s=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.addPreMatchCondSimproc\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">addPreMatchCondSimproc</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Simp.Simprocs\">Simprocs</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Simp.Simprocs\">Simprocs</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Adds `reducePreMatchCond` to `s`","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.addPreMatchCondSimproc","kind":"def","line":171,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.addPreMatchCondSimproc","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.lean#L171-L173"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.reducePreMatchCond\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">reducePreMatchCond</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Simp.DSimproc\">Simp.DSimproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.reducePreMatchCond","kind":"def","line":167,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.reducePreMatchCond","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.lean#L167-L169"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.isPreMatchCond\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">isPreMatchCond</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.isPreMatchCond","kind":"def","line":164,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.isPreMatchCond","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.lean#L164-L165"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.markAsPreMatchCond\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">markAsPreMatchCond</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `Grind.PreMatchCond e`.\nRecall that `Grind.PreMatchCond` is an identity function,\nbut the simproc `reducePreMatchCond` is used to prevent the term `e` from being simplified.\n`Grind.PreMatchCond` is later converted into `Grind.MatchCond`.\nSee comment at `MatchCond.lean`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.markAsPreMatchCond","kind":"def","line":154,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.markAsPreMatchCond","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.lean#L154-L162"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.isMatchCond\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">isMatchCond</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.isMatchCond","kind":"def","line":151,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.isMatchCond","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.lean#L151-L152"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.markAsMatchCond\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">markAsMatchCond</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `Grind.MatchCond e`.\nWe have special support for propagating is truth value.\nSee comment at `MatchCond.lean`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.markAsMatchCond","kind":"def","line":143,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.markAsMatchCond","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.lean#L143-L149"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.normalize\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">normalize</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">config</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Grind/Config.html#Lean.Grind.Config\">Grind.Config</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Normalizes the given expression using the `grind` simplification theorems and simprocs.\nThis function is used for normalizing E-matching patterns. Note that it does not return a proof.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.normalize","kind":"opaque","line":136,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.normalize","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.lean#L136-L141"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.foldProjs\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">foldProjs</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Converts nested `Expr.proj`s into projection applications if possible.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.foldProjs","kind":"def","line":129,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.foldProjs","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.lean#L129-L133"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.MVarId.eraseIrrelevantMData\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">MVarId</span>.<span class=\"name\">eraseIrrelevantMData</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Erases the irrelevant `Expr.mdata` of the goal's target, see `eraseIrrelevantMData`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.MVarId.eraseIrrelevantMData","kind":"def","line":125,"name":"Lean.MVarId.eraseIrrelevantMData","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.lean#L125-L127"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.eraseIrrelevantMData\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">eraseIrrelevantMData</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"In the `grind` tactic, during `Expr` internalization, we don't expect to find `Expr.mdata`.\nThis function ensures `Expr.mdata` is not found during internalization.\nRecall that we do not internalize `Expr.lam` children.\nRecall that we still have to process `Expr.forallE` because of `ForallProp.lean`.\nMoreover, we may not want to reduce `p → q` to `¬p ∨ q` when `(p q : Prop)`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.eraseIrrelevantMData","kind":"def","line":109,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.eraseIrrelevantMData","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.lean#L109-L123"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Util.html#Lean.MVarId.clearImplDetails\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">MVarId</span>.<span class=\"name\">clearImplDetails</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Clears auxiliary **and** implementation detail decls used to encode recursive declarations and\nimplementation details.\n- `grind` eliminates auxiliary declarations to ensure they are not accidentally used by its proof automation.\n- `grind` eliminates implementation detail declarations because they have a support role.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Gri